      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF 是基于 Qwen3 混合专家架构的代码模型，总参数量30B但每个token仅激活3B，兼具高性能与低开销。它通过 Unsloth 的 GGUF 量化，可在普通本地设备上以4-8比特精度运行，适合代码补全、生成、修复等场景。开源且兼容多种推理框架，既是离线编程助手的理想内核，也可作为微调基底。开发时无需云端API，数据更安全。",
        "en": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF is an efficient, open-source code model built on Qwen3's mixture-of-experts architecture. It activates only 3B of 30B parameters per token, delivering strong coding abilities at a fraction of the compute. Unsloth's GGUF quantization makes it pra…",
        "es": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF is an efficient, open-source code model built on Qwen3's mixture-of-experts architecture. It activates only 3B of 30B parameters per token, delivering strong coding abilities at a fraction of the compute. Unsloth's GGUF quantization makes it pra…"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF 是基于 Qwen3 混合专家架构的代码模型，总参数量30B但每个token仅激活3B，兼具高性能与低开销。它通过 Unsloth 的 GGUF 量化，可在普通本地设备上以4-8比特精度运行，适合代码补全、生成、修复等场景。开源且兼容多种推理框架，既是离线编程助手的理想内核，也可作为微调基底。开发时无需云端API，数据更安全。",
        "en": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF is an efficient, open-source code model built on Qwen3's mixture-of-experts architecture. It activates only 3B of 30B parameters per token, delivering strong coding abilities at a fraction of the compute. Unsloth's GGUF quantization makes it practical to run locally on consumer hardware, from 4-bit to 8-bit precision. Use it for code completion, generation, bug fixing, or as a backend for development tools without cloud dependency. Its compact footprint and Apache-2.0 license make it a flexible baseline for fine-tuning or building coding assistants.",
        "es": "Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF is an efficient, open-source code model built on Qwen3's mixture-of-experts architecture. It activates only 3B of 30B parameters per token, delivering strong coding abilities at a fraction of the compute. Unsloth's GGUF quantization makes it practical to run locally on consumer hardware, from 4-bit to 8-bit precision. Use it for code completion, generation, bug fixing, or as a backend for development tools without cloud dependency. Its compact footprint and Apache-2.0 license make it a flexible baseline for fine-tuning or building coding assistants."
      },
