      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B是一个轻量级自动语音识别模型，目标是以小模型实现高效准确的语音转文字。它通过优化的Transformer架构和训练方法，在0.6B参数下取得不错的识别精度，并保持低延迟，适合边缘设备和实时应用。模型以Apache-2.0开源，提供Safetensors权重，可直接运行，也支持微调适配特定领域。你可以用它开发语音转录工具、字幕生成器或语音交互界面，在手机和服务器上灵活部署。",
        "en": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B is a compact automatic speech recognition model that transcribes speech to text efficiently while requiring minimal compute. Its strength lies in balancing a small parameter count (0.6B) with solid accuracy, making it suitable for resource-constrained devices and …",
        "es": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B is a compact automatic speech recognition model that transcribes speech to text efficiently while requiring minimal compute. Its strength lies in balancing a small parameter count (0.6B) with solid accuracy, making it suitable for resource-constrained devices and …"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B是一个轻量级自动语音识别模型，目标是以小模型实现高效准确的语音转文字。它通过优化的Transformer架构和训练方法，在0.6B参数下取得不错的识别精度，并保持低延迟，适合边缘设备和实时应用。模型以Apache-2.0开源，提供Safetensors权重，可直接运行，也支持微调适配特定领域。你可以用它开发语音转录工具、字幕生成器或语音交互界面，在手机和服务器上灵活部署。",
        "en": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B is a compact automatic speech recognition model that transcribes speech to text efficiently while requiring minimal compute. Its strength lies in balancing a small parameter count (0.6B) with solid accuracy, making it suitable for resource-constrained devices and real-time pipelines. Technically, it leverages the Qwen3 ASR architecture with Safetensors weights and Apache-2.0 licensing. In practice, you can fine-tune it for specific languages or domains, or integrate it directly into applications for transcription, subtitles, and voice commands, whether on edge devices or in the cloud.",
        "es": "Qwen3-ASR-0.6B is a compact automatic speech recognition model that transcribes speech to text efficiently while requiring minimal compute. Its strength lies in balancing a small parameter count (0.6B) with solid accuracy, making it suitable for resource-constrained devices and real-time pipelines. Technically, it leverages the Qwen3 ASR architecture with Safetensors weights and Apache-2.0 licensing. In practice, you can fine-tune it for specific languages or domains, or integrate it directly into applications for transcription, subtitles, and voice commands, whether on edge devices or in the cloud."
      },
